a(1,'M2E',20,58,'tri','In triangle ABC, DE is parallel to AC, D lies on AB, E lies on BC, BD = AD, BE = 9, and AC = 8. What is BC?',['72','18','17','16'],'B','BD=AD makes BD/BA=1/2. Similar triangles BDE and BAC give BE/BC=1/2, so BC=18.',[110,755,430,1025])
