a(1,'M2H',1,61,'tri','In the figure, lines ℓ and k are parallel and transversal t intersects both. If x > 137, which statement must be true?',['y < 43','y > 43','x + y < 180','x + y > 180'],'A','The labeled angles are supplementary: x+y=180. Thus x>137 implies y<43.',[110,705,420,1020])
