a(1,'M2H',6,62,'lin','A plumber charges $116 for the first hour, $70 for each additional hour, and $z for parts. Which equation gives total cost y for x hours, where x ≥ 1?',['y = 70x + z','y = 70x + z + 46','y = 116x + z','y = 116x + 70z + 46'],'B','y=116+70(x−1)+z=70x+z+46.')
