a(1,'M2H',10,63,'exp',r'A bacterial population follows \(P(t)=250(1.08)^t\), where t is in hours. By what percentage does it increase each hour?',['0.08%','8%','25%','108%'],'B','The hourly factor 1.08 equals 1+0.08, so the increase is 8%.')
