a(1,'M2H',16,65,'sys',r'The system \(x^2+y^2=64\), \(y=mx+\frac b2\) has negative constants m and b and an intersection (−7,y) with y<0. Which expression equals b?',[r'\(14m-2\sqrt{15}\)',r'\(-14m+2\sqrt{15}\)',r'\(\frac{7m}{2}-\frac{\sqrt{15}}2\)',r'\(-\frac{7m}{2}+\frac{\sqrt{15}}2\)'],'A','49+y²=64 and y<0 give y=−√15. Substitute into y=−7m+b/2, yielding b=14m−2√15.')
